#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.8.0"
msgstr "v1.8.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.8.0 is a WiFi-and-tuning release: it speeds up the WINC SPI bus, fixes a "
"batch of WINC socket bugs, caps the maximum FPS reduction, and changes the "
"default auto-gain ceiling to 8x. The gain-ceiling default change is a "
"behavior change — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v1.8.0 je izdanje usmjereno na WiFi i podešavanje: ubrzava WINC SPI "
"sabirnicu, ispravlja niz grešaka WINC socketa, ograničava maksimalno "
"smanjenje FPS-a i mijenja zadanu gornju granicu automatskog pojačanja na 8x."
" Promjena zadane gornje granice pojačanja je promjena ponašanja — pročitajte"
" promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost u nastavku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:19
msgid "**Faster WiFi** — higher WINC SPI baud rate, with socket fixes."
msgstr ""
"**Brži WiFi** — viša WINC SPI brzina prijenosa (baud), s ispravcima socketa."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:20
msgid "**FPS cap** — the maximum FPS reduction is capped at 1/2 FPS (30 FPS)."
msgstr ""
"**Ograničenje FPS-a** — maksimalno smanjenje FPS-a ograničeno je na 1/2 FPS "
"(30 FPS)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the default auto-gain ceiling changed to 8x — see the breaking"
" changes."
msgstr ""
"**Narušava kompatibilnost:** zadana gornja granica automatskog pojačanja "
"promijenjena je na 8x — pogledajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:25
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:27
msgid "Added an FPS test script."
msgstr "Dodana skripta za testiranje FPS-a."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:30
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"Raised the WINC SPI baud rate / speed for faster WiFi; capped the maximum "
"FPS reduction at 1/2 FPS (30 FPS); cleaned up the debug logging and the "
"MJPEG streaming example."
msgstr ""
"Povišena WINC SPI brzina prijenosa (baud) / brzina za brži WiFi; maksimalno "
"smanjenje FPS-a ograničeno na 1/2 FPS (30 FPS); sređeno zapisivanje za "
"otklanjanje grešaka i primjer MJPEG strujanja."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:37
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:39
msgid ""
"Fixed the default framebuffer state, WINC socket ``accept`` info, WINC "
"``socket_send``, and cleaned up the socket / async-request error handling."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno zadano stanje međuspremnika slike, WINC socket ``accept`` "
"informacije, WINC ``socket_send`` te sređeno rukovanje greškama socketa / "
"asinkronih zahtjeva."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:43
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v1.7.0 and v1.8.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Korisniku vidljive promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost između "
"v1.7.0 i v1.8.0. Opseg: Python C-moduli u ``modules/`` i Python biblioteke u"
" ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"The breaking change is a *behavior* change (same API, different result) — "
"re-check affected scripts. Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Promjena koja narušava kompatibilnost je promjena *behavior* (isti API, "
"drugačiji rezultat) — ponovno provjerite pogođene skripte. Svaki hash "
"commita vodi na njegov diff na GitHubu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:54
msgid "Default auto-gain ceiling changed to 8x *(behavior)*"
msgstr ""
"Zadana gornja granica automatskog pojačanja promijenjena na 8x *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:56
msgid ""
"The default auto-gain ceiling was changed to 8x. Scripts that relied on the "
"previous default gain ceiling will see different image brightness/noise "
"under auto-gain — set an explicit gain ceiling if you need the old behavior."
msgstr ""
"Zadana gornja granica automatskog pojačanja promijenjena je na 8x. Skripte "
"koje su se oslanjale na prethodnu zadanu granicu pojačanja vidjet će "
"drugačiju svjetlinu/šum slike pri automatskom pojačanju — postavite "
"eksplicitnu gornju granicu pojačanja ako trebate staro ponašanje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:60
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `bdafca5a7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bdafca5a7>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `bdafca5a7 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bdafca5a7>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:65
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.8.0.rst:67
msgid ""
"Set an explicit gain ceiling if your script depended on the previous default"
" (:ref:`the gain-ceiling change <v1_8_0_gainceiling>`). All other scripts "
"run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Postavite eksplicitnu gornju granicu pojačanja ako je vaša skripta ovisila o"
" prethodnoj zadanoj vrijednosti (\\ :ref:`promjena gornje granice pojačanja "
"<v1_8_0_gainceiling>`\\ ). Sve ostale skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
